<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 20,000 MT resulted as increases for Saudi Arabia (50,000 MT, switched from unknown destinations) and Japan (20,000 MT).</p>
<p>There were no exports reported this week.</p>
</text>
